T:It Came Upon A Midnight Clear
T:CAROL
C:Music: Richard S. Willis, 1861 · Words: Edmund H. Sears, 1849
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Order of worship for the Reformed Church in the United States", 1866 Hymn 63. supposed to be found in "Church Corals and Choir Studies" 1850 by Willis, but I d. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/carol_willis): 99% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
